  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amendment to current Diakonia Framework Agreement, related to EU3     (third) co-financing of Diakonia own contribution to five EU funded   project . budget lines EIDHR and NSA. The contribution is valid from  2013-2017 thereby surpassing the current contract period.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Till&#xe4;ggsavtal Eu3 till Diakonias ramavtal. Svensk samfinansiering av   egeninsatsen till fem EU-projekt i olika l&#xe4;nder under EUs            budgetlinjer EIDHR (Demo) och NSA (CSO-linjen). Insatsen l&#xf6;per under  perioden 2013-2017, d&#xe4;rmed bortom nuvarande avtalsperiod mellan Sida  och diakonia.</narrative>
  </description>
